OpenDriveMap.xodr

# SimLingo resolves its InternVL2 cache as `pretrained/<variant>` relative to
# the CWD, and the harness runs a method in its own repository directory -- so
# this is a link to wherever the backbone actually lives on the node. Multiple
# gigabytes; never a tracked file.
/pretrained
